---
/* Home-screen character field. This element is an empty shell on purpose: buildAscii()
   creates the <canvas> and the WebGL2 program inside it at runtime.
   See port/04-ASCII-FIELD.md before touching any attribute here. */
---
<div data-ascii="" style="position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:5;font-family:'SN Ja Mono',ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:300;font-size:13px;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:0;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.3);white-space:pre;overflow:hidden;cursor:crosshair;transition:opacity 400ms ease"></div>
